---
description: After fixing or changing this Android project, commit and push to origin/main so GitHub Actions builds the APK.
alwaysApply: true
---

When you change code or CI in this repo:

1. Stage only relevant files (never secrets or `local.properties`).
2. Commit with a clear message.
3. Run `git push origin main` without asking the user to push manually.

The remote is `https://github.com/itsadonx/dtr-scanner.git`. APK builds run automatically on push via `.github/workflows/build-apk.yml`.
